# 20. Ingress

Ingress manages HTTP/HTTPS routing.

Example:

Without Ingress:

```text
Application A

↓

Load Balancer


Application B

↓

Load Balancer
```

Cost increases.

---

With Ingress:

```text
                Internet

                    |

              ALB Ingress


          /api        /web


        Backend     Frontend
```

---

# 21. Ingress Example

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1

kind: Ingress

metadata:

  name: app-ingress


spec:

  rules:

  - host: example.com

    http:

      paths:

      - path: /

        backend:

          service:

            name: frontend

            port:

              number: 80
```

---

